 "format": "Commander",
 "name": "Man-At-Arms: Dwarven Armory",
 "notes": [
  "Commander is the Man-At-Arms printing of Bruenor Battlehammer: each creature gets +2/+0 per attached Equipment, and the first equip each turn is free.",
  "From the By the Power of Grayskull! Secret Lair: Bruenor, Delina (Orko), Konda's Banner (He-Man's Battle Harness) and the bonus Charge of Eternia (Full Throttle). Crackle with Power stays out, as you suggested.",
  "Konda's Banner on Bruenor is the anthem: it needs a legendary creature, then Dwarves get +2/+2 and other red or white creatures +1/+1.",
  "Plan: flood the board with Fíli the Pathfinder, Dwarven Hammer, Dwarven Shortsword and An Unexpected Party, spread free equips, then finish with Full Throttle or Dáin of the Ancient Halls.",
  "Winota stays on the bench: a Dwarf deck runs only 3 Humans, so her trigger would rarely hit. Puresteel Paladin takes the slot.",
  "Estimated, not simulated: wins around turns 7–9. Fastest line is Bruenor with Colossus Hammer plus Konda's Banner, which swings for 21 commander damage from about turn 6. Mention that at the table, since it's the deck's most Bracket 3-feeling moment. Early game is strong: lots of 2-drops and 5 cheap answers.",
  "Bruenor's free equip applies only to the first equip each turn; Bearded Axe scales with Dwarves and Equipment, so it's usually the best second attachment.",
  "Rares and mythics to pick up or check your binder for: An Unexpected Party; Balin, Loremaster; Blackblade Reforged; Chaos Warp; Depala, Pilot Exemplar; Dwalin, Weaponmaster; Dáin Ironfoot; Dáin of the Ancient Halls; Dáin's Company; Fíli and Kíli, Joyous; Fíli the Pathfinder; Gimli of the Glittering Caves; Kíli the Resourceful; Magda, Brazen Outlaw; Puresteel Paladin; Rugged Prairie; Sram, Senior Edificer; Sunbaked Canyon; Sword of the Animist; Temple of Triumph; The Lonely Mountain; Thorin, King of Durin's Folk; Thorin, Mountain-king",
  "Commons and uncommons to pick up or check your binder for: Aerial Responder; Bearded Axe; Bladehold War-Whip; Boros Charm; Boros Garrison; Colossus Hammer; Command Tower; Danitha Capashen, Paragon; Diamond Pick-Axe; Dwarven Hammer; Dwarven Mine; Dwarven Recruiter; Dwarven Reinforcements; Evolving Wilds; Fairgrounds Warden; Fearless Liberator; Generous Gift; Giott, King of the Dwarves; Hero's Blade; Loran's Escape; Mind Stone; Open the Armory; Path of Ancestry; Reyav, Master Smith; Rogue's Passage; Terramorphic Expanse; Warchanter Skald; Wind-Scarred Crag",
  "Hobbit or Lord of the Rings commons and uncommons you likely have from half displays: Bifur, Melodic Rider; Bofur, Reliable Guardian; Bombur, Gentle Dreamer; Dori, Bearer of Friends; Dwarven Mattock; Dwarven Mauler; Dwarven Shortsword; Dáin, Lord of the Iron Hills; Glóin the Mighty; Iron Hills; Iron Hills Blacksmith; Iron Hills Stalwart; Thorin Oakenshield; Vow to Erebor; Éowyn, Lady of Rohan; Óin the Brave"
 ],
